cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CysMutML, please cite it as software."
title: "CysMutML: Hybrid ML and structural-bioinformatics prioritization of cysteine mutations"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-08-25"
authors:
  - name: "John Connor"
license: "MIT"
abstract: "CysMutML is a lightweight hybrid ML and structural-bioinformatics pipeline for prioritizing candidate cysteine substitutions using FireProtDB-trained physicochemical mutation modeling and transparent target-PDB structural heuristics."
